# The radar half hashes file bytes, so a CRLF checkout on Windows changes a
# run_id and fails 27 of its tests. Its own .gitattributes carried this line
# before the merge; it has to survive here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Data files derived by the pipeline or from ATO/Register sources.
# linguist-generated hides them from the language bar and diff stats,
# so the repository reads as the Python pipeline it is.
fadden/manifest_md.json linguist-generated
fadden/pii_flagged.json linguist-generated
fadden/titles_principal.json linguist-generated
